    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2cf0a9224ae3044b0294371",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "经过很多努力，我终于成为了这所学园的专属训练员。\n虽然经验尚浅，但我的热情要比别人多一倍。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7233aa4d07c0077737bbb997cdbb2a34509c46b9df44da1f2c93e65fcec23b35",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
