    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ddfcd14619afaa8956fd4a50",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "鼓足了干劲后，我开始观摩在跑道上奔跑着的马娘们。\n看着她们拼命的样子，我不由自主伸出手，发出呐喊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad4caf333a59a013a4b02e442833dca5ca7b2b1606a918fd0ae0d68899bd0120",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
