      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "对我来说『萌』，就是灵魂的洗涤！！！！　对推的敬爱\n和敬畏给我这身灵魂带来了光明，化作了一线希望――！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d28a14e7fa619d4b2acc707dd47e96ed748da895792ffcc4895dada1878f341",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
