      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "啊啊，真火大～……！\n每次每次，她都挤到我要跑的位置――",
      "source_fingerprint": "97ffda36f8b2485b65a1bafd5ea697a0a3c3fab33ef556d5e093af17b4b00228",
