      "uid": "zhcn:b0bbb056e19dd38fc875b3d1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "使全力为她加油后，\n她以惊人的速度跑过了最终直线……！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd3ff623bd6d46245ba02e085d57c2772c447e381ce2a22bff9d7124a0996272",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
